### ============================================
### 文件管理模块测试 (vellastra-file :8086)
### ============================================

### 1. 单文件上传（图片）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/file/upload?category=image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./data/test.png
--boundary123--

### 2. 分块上传 - 初始化
POST http://localhost:8080/api/file/upload/init?fileName=bigfile.zip&totalSize=10485760&totalChunks=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {% client.global.set("uploadId", response.body.data.uploadId); %}

### 3. 分块上传 - 上传分块 0
POST http://localhost:8080/api/file/upload/chunk?uploadId={{uploadId}}&chunkIndex=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunk"; filename="chunk0.bin"

chunk-data-0
--boundary123--

### 4. 分块上传 - 合并
POST http://localhost:8080/api/file/upload/complete?uploadId={{uploadId}}&fileName=bigfile.zip&category=doc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1

### 5. 分块上传 - 取消
POST http://localhost:8080/api/file/upload/cancel?uploadId={{uploadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
